# Firebase service-account keys (FCM v1 push credentials, etc.) - always
# named like this by Firebase's own "generate new private key" download,
# never meant to be committed. NOT google-services.json - that one IS
# needed inside the EAS Build upload (app.json's android.googleServicesFile
# references it by path), and EAS skips anything gitignored.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json

# macOS
.DS_Store
*.pem

